{"type":"message","id":"41dc2343","parentId":"096b5574","timestamp":"2026-04-27T01:19:23.660Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_k05CCmZcZB0IjFEHZzT1iSAS","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: feishu-channel-rules\ndescription: |\n  Lark/Feishu channel output rules. Always active in Lark conversations.\nalwaysActive: true\n---\n\n# Lark Output Rules\n\n## Writing Style\n\n- Short, conversational, low ceremony — talk like a coworker, not a manual\n- Prefer plain sentences over bullet lists when a brief answer suffices\n- Get to the point and stop — no need for a summary paragraph every time\n\n## Note\n\n- Lark Markdown differs from standard Markdown in some ways; when unsure, refer to `references/markdown-syntax.md`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1777252763656}}
{"type":"message","id":"057be913","parentId":"41dc2343","timestamp":"2026-04-27T01:19:39.089Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 这版有几个点挺醒目：\n\n1. **最像“右侧继续”的是 ENSO / 0G / AVNT**\n   都是**负费率 + 涨幅为正**，说明空头在堆，价格却没被砸下去，典型有挤空燃料。  \n   里面我会先盯 **AVNT**，因为它不只是追多榜，还进了综合榜，结构更完整一点。\n\n2. **最像“提前埋伏观察”的是 RAYSOL / ORCA**\n   现在是**热度先起来，OI 还没完全跟上**，这种更像“庄家先点火，看看有没有后续资金接”。  \n   不是立即确认型，但适合放进观察池。\n\n3. **AGT 已经进入“正在发生”阶段**\n   热度和 OI 一起爆，强是强，但这类通常也更容易进到高波动和洗盘区，追的话要更小心节奏。\n\n4. **1000LUNC 是偏埋伏逻辑，不是追涨逻辑**\n   横盘时间长，OI 又明显抬升，比较像有人在提前卡位。问题是体量更大，启动未必会像小票那么猛。\n\n如果只让我从这张表里挑 **3 个优先盯盘**，我会是：\n\n- **AVNT**：最均衡\n- **ENSO**：挤空味最重\n- **RAYSOL**：像早期预热票\n\n如果你愿意，我可以直接把这份表**整理成“今天可交易优先级”**，分成：\n- 右侧追随\n- 左侧埋伏\n- 只看不做  \n给你出一个更实战的版本。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":361,"output":745,"cacheRead":33792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34898,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777252763660,"responseId":"resp_0b4c0a07f87b49410169eeb99eab4c8191be805edcc84d00d1"}}
